  ## Basic Assembly
  1. Assemble the detonator by installing one of the triggers and inserting the detonating cord.
  <Box>
  <GuideEntityEmbed Entity="BoxDetonator" Caption="" Scale="2"/>
  <GuideEntityEmbed Entity="WiredDetonator" Caption="" Scale="2"/>
  </Box>
  <Box>
  2. Lay the detonating cord across the floor where you want to create a controlled blast for demolition. The explosion is powerful enough to breach a wall, but its radius is small enough to keep you out of harm's way.
  </Box>
